	(text "Max load of ~400ma observed\nwith a black C2N when motor is\nstalled at end-of-tape during\nrewind.\n\n6.1V @ 1A allows 400ma per\ncassette port with some headroom.\n\nVoltage is non-critical as the\ndatasette speed is controlled by\na mechanical governor."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 232.41 73.66 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d3af371b-eb23-4d75-8c1b-61cf84e3f244")
	)
	(text "AMS1117 datasheet specifies 22u tant,\nbut does not state a required ESR\nrange for stability.\n\nTI LM1117 specifies 0.3-22Ω. Each C_{OUT}\nis 3Ω @ 100kHz (for 1.5Ω in parallel).\n\nAMS1117 internal protection diodes\nsufficient with output caps < 1000uF"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 118.11 193.04 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "e2f3c9c0-778d-439c-b715-986d67505161")
	)
